<title>INDIA: India Zee 96/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India Zee 96/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	   (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    288.17    vs	 230.27</p>
<p>    Sales		   892.57    vs	 881.78</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)	15.53    vs	  12.39</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	 4.50    vs	   3.50</p>
<p>    Other income	   23.63    vs	   9.35</p>
<p>    Expenses		617.58    vs	 634.71</p>
<p>    Interest		 36.59    vs	  10.00</p>
<p>    Gross profit	  340.39    vs	 246.43</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    7.71    vs	   6.95</p>
<p>    Tax			44.51    vs	  10.21</p>
<p>Note - Zee Telefilms Ltd makes films and entertainment programmes for its extensive satelite TV network.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
